What is AI in ICT?
AI in ICT represents the integration of artificial intelligence technologies including machine learning, natural language processing, and cognitive computing into information and communication technology ecosystems. It powers intelligent network optimization, predictive maintenance in telecom infrastructure, automated cybersecurity defenses, and self-healing cloud architectures. Unlike standalone AI applications, these solutions form the neural network enabling next-generation digital infrastructure.

